OL,3,GNEWSAPensioners divided over plans to
OL,4,Aaxe triple lock
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe state pension triple lock is on the
OL,7,Fway out - with pensioners in
OL,8,FWorcestershire concerned that the
OL,9,Fchange could leave them worse off.
OL,11,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham intends to
OL,12,Fwater it down from 2030 to help fund a
OL,13,Fnational care service by removing a
OL,14,Fguarantee that pensions will rise in
OL,15,Fline with earnings.
OL,17,FThe BBC went to a bingo club in
OL,18,FWorcester, where people said they were
OL,19,Fworried about the impact.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
