OL,3,GNEWSAPensioners divided over plans to
OL,4,Aaxe triple lock
OL,5,
OL,6,FMary Davies, 89, said: "I think it's
OL,7,Fwrong - people of our generation will
OL,8,Fbe missing out." But Burnham said it
OL,9,Fwas a "good deal for pensioners".
